        <param>
          <type>const TArray&lt; FString &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>ModelTypes</declname>
          <defval>{}</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Every language any registered model declares, sorted - the source for the settings language dropdown.</para>
<para>A <bold>union</bold>, deliberately, not an intersection: a project may register an English-only model for one character and a 31-language voice for everyone else, and intersecting would collapse the menu to English. Per-model mismatches are surfaced where they are actionable instead - on the model picker (inspector warning) and at agent creation (server error).</para>
<para>Empty ModelTypes means &quot;all types&quot;. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
